  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening research systems for poverty reduction in East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the effectiveness of countries own investments in research for development and increase the numbers of research leaders in East Africa. The programme will also document learning and build a robust evidence base on what works to strengthen national research.  This contributes to countries long-term, sustainable development because of the role research plays in supporting sound public policy, effective education systems and economic growth.</narrative>
  </description>
